Olympus Hotel & Suites is a budget-to-midscale hotel located in the Oluyole/Apata area of Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria.

Location & Contact

• Address: 27 / 29 Ibadan-Abeokuta Road, Fatimah Bus Stop, by 110 Roundabout, Akinyemi Exit, Off Ring Road, Oluyole, Ibadan, Oyo State
• Phone / Contact: +234 913 905 2671 / +234 815 951 1334
• Social Media: Olympus Hotel & Suites Instagram & Facebook Page

Facilities & Features

• On-Site Amenities: Restaurant, bar/lounge, outdoor swimming pool, open-space areas, upper-floor snooker/game section, and a club/nightlife space.
• Services: 24-hour front desk, room service, free parking, and complimentary breakfast options for lodgers.
• Nearby Landmarks: The Palms Shopping Mall (approx. 3 km), Lekan Salami Stadium, and Agodi Gardens.